---
/* Panel 3 — EQUIPMENT RENTAL.
   Verbatim from the design. Do not change gallery order, [data-sq]/[data-par] nesting, or the
   inline percentages on [data-par]: the parallax cap is derived from that overhang.
   [data-bd] is this panel's black backdrop — see port/00-PORT-PLAN.md section 7. */
---
<div data-panel="" data-i="3" style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:clamp(14px,3vh,34px);opacity:0;min-height:0">
<div data-imgs="" style="flex:1 1 64%;min-height:clamp(110px,26vh,340px);display:flex;gap:20px;will-change:transform">
<div data-inv="" style="flex:0 0 32%;min-width:0;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center">
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="GX3.png" data-tip="The flagship server for touring and live events, the disguise gx3 boasts the best-in-class graphics card for real-time content and visual effects" style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgb(217,225,234);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">DISGUISE GX3</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="gx2c.png" data-tip="The industry workhorse, and a great solution for real time performances on a budget." style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">DISGUISE GX2C</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="vx4.png" data-tip="The server for when you need to push as many pixels as possible." style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">DISGUISE VX4</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="gx2.png" data-tip="The most budget friendly server with all the benefits of the disguise software platform. Great for simple shows, starter tours, or basic Notch IMAG treatments." style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">DISGUISE GX2</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="vx2.png" data-tip="The server for smaller XR or experiential projects. Better GPU hardware than a gx2, and less expensive than a gx3, the vx2 makes for a great previz machine, or pure director for larger shows." style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">DISGUISE VX2</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="rx2.png" data-tip="The server required for XR, VP and Unreal Renderstream projects." style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">DISGUISE RX2</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="Mellanox-SN2010.png" data-tip="The most budget friendly server with all the benefits of the disguise software platform. Great for simple shows, starter tours, or basic Notch IMAG treatments." style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">RENDERSTREAM HARDWARE</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="vfc.png" data-tip="We carry VFC cards for every connection type. SDI VFC · HDMI VFC · DISPLAYPORT VFC · DVI VFC" style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">VFC CARDS</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="OmniCal_Ipod_1.png" data-tip="iPod Kit" style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">DISGUISE OMNICAL</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="SilverDraft.png" data-tip="AOIN has a fleet of 10 Silverdraft render engines, racked and ready for Augmented Reality, Ndisplay, or Render farm scenarios. The servers are available with either a fresh windows install, or a custom disk image purpose built for any use case." style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">SILVERDRAFT A6000 RENDER NODES</button>
<button type="button" data-inv-row="" data-img="CustomRacks.png" data-tip="AOIN can also provide prebuilt, custom configured racks that are built for plug and play project rentals. Each rack is custom built for each project, and ready for anything, from Music Touring, Augmented Reality for Broadcast, Ndisplay Render nodes or onsite render farms." style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(11px,1.5vh,15px);letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 240ms ease">CUSTOM RACK BUILD SOLUTIONS</button>
</div>
<div style="flex:1;min-width:0;height:100%;display:grid;place-items:center">
<img data-inv-img="" src="https://allofitnow.com/wp-content/uploads/GX3.png" alt="Disguise gx3" style="max-height:100%;max-width:70%;object-fit:contain;display:block;transition:opacity 220ms ease"></div>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:64px;align-items:end">
<p data-copy="" style="margin:0;columns:2;column-gap:48px;font-size:clamp(12px,1.6vh,19px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.86);text-wrap:pretty">All of it Now provides a comprehensive range of equipment rentals designed to support your production needs. As a long time Disguise solutions partner and workflow specialist, AOIN has disguise servers available in many different configurations.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:max-content">
<button type="button" data-other="" data-target="0" style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:9px 100px 9px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms ease">REAL-TIME CONTENT</button>
<button type="button" data-other="" data-target="1" style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:9px 100px 9px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms ease">SCREENS PRODUCTION</button>
<button type="button" data-other="" data-target="2" style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:9px 100px 9px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms ease">MIXED REALITY</button>
<button type="button" data-other="" data-target="3" style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.02em;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(217,225,234,0.28);background:none;color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45);padding:9px 100px 9px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms ease">EQUIPMENT RENTAL</button>
</div>
</div>
<div data-bd="" style="position:absolute;inset:-8px -60px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0);z-index:-1"></div>
</div>
